From: cwriter <https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp/pull/31428>
Subject: [PATCH] sycl: Improve Grouped XMX GEMM by avoiding SLM staging (PR 31428, draft)

The two PR commits on top of PR 30156 collapsed into one diff (the first creates
fused-gemm-esimd.cpp/.hpp, the second edits them, and git apply -R of the series would
leave the new files behind):
  acfa9400 sycl : ESIMD grouped MoE GEMM on canonical (non-reordered) weights too
  ffac3826 sycl : ESIMD grouped MoE GEMM that dequantizes straight into the dpas operands

